Package: calculiva
Type: Package
Title: Home Improvement Estimators for Mulch, Topsoil and Sod
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Calculiva", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "contact@calculiva.com")
Description: Planning quantities for home improvement projects: mulch by bed,
    tree ring, known area, play structure or swing; topsoil and fill dirt by
    area with bags, bulk, weight and trips; sod by area with a staggered
    piece layout, pallets, plugs and soil preparation. A port of the Go module
    'calculiva-go' (same version and test vectors), itself a port of the
    engine of the calculators on <https://calculiva.com/>. The method is
    described at <https://calculiva.com/how-we-calculate/>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://calculiva.com/, https://calculiva.com/how-we-calculate/,
    https://github.com/calculiva/calculiva-r
BugReports: https://github.com/calculiva/calculiva-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests: jsonlite, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
